<p>This post references the canola image that is already an explicit attachment:</p>
<img src="https://example.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/canola.jpg" alt="Canola Field" width="800" height="600" />
<p>It also has a resized version of the same image:</p>
<img src="https://example.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/canola-300x200.jpg" alt="Canola Thumbnail" />
<p>Neither of these should create duplicate attachments.</p>
